simplesect.para:
an array that contains an expression indicating each dimension's size. OWNERSHIP of the expressions is TRANSFERED TO the CALLER (which becomes responsible for freeing the expressions). If the first array dimension was not specified an expression that indicates that size is generated. intx[][3]={1,2,3,4,5,6};
 the entry for the first dimension will be: //3...sizeof2nddimension
sizeof(x)/(sizeof(int)*3)
